From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] mfplat: the property store Commit stays E_NOTIMPL

2830 made IPropertyStore::Commit of the mfplat property store return S_OK.
dlls/mfplat/tests/mfplat.c (test_property_store) expects E_NOTIMPL, as
Windows answers: back to E_NOTIMPL.

---
diff --git a/dlls/mfplat/main.c b/dlls/mfplat/main.c
index 8532fa5..abbb15a 100644
--- a/dlls/mfplat/main.c
+++ b/dlls/mfplat/main.c
@@ -8862,8 +8862,7 @@ static HRESULT WINAPI property_store_Commit(IPropertyStore *iface)
 {
     TRACE("%p.\n", iface);
 
-    /* the values only live in memory: there is nothing to write out */
-    return S_OK;
+    return E_NOTIMPL;
 }
 
 static const IPropertyStoreVtbl property_store_vtbl =
